<title>SRI LANKA: Tokyo Cement (Lanka) to issue rights.</title>
<headline>Tokyo Cement (Lanka) to issue rights.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tokyo Cement (Lanka) Ltd said in a statement on Tuesday that it was making a rights issue of one share for every two held.</p>
<p>The rights issue would be made at 50 rupees a 10-rupee share.</p>
<p>After the issue, the company's issued share capital will rise to 15 million shares from the current 10 million, analysts said.</p>
<p>Shares of the firm were last traded at 64.50 rupees on Monday.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
